"""Benchmark questions for the `litreview` collection (48 papers) and the
`bench_injection` collection (2 real papers + 1 document carrying a prompt injection).

Gold facts were verified against the stored node text (bench/grep_nodes.py) and,
for figure questions, by looking at the figure images.

Fields
  id, level (1 easy .. 5 adversarial), category, question
  expect     answer | not_found | refuse | decline_offtopic
  gold       reference facts / expected behaviour for the LLM judge
  must_cite  doc_ids that must appear among the citations
  expect_docs / optional_docs   listing questions: recall/precision over cited doc_ids
  must_not_contain             strings that must not appear in the answer (case-insensitive)
  collection defaults to litreview
"""

